WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.537
After shopping, we were very hungry, so we went to eat lunch.

2
00:00:08.538 --> 00:00:11.759
Mom: Hana, you can order whatever you want.

3
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.440
Here is the money. Hana:

4
00:00:13.441 --> 00:00:15.373
What about Bada?

5
00:00:15.374 --> 00:00:17.929
Mom: I will order for both of us.

6
00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:22.686
Hana: Let me try.

7
00:00:22.687 --> 00:00:24.131
