10
00:00:35.727 --> 00:00:38.593
Hana: A small orange juice, please.

11
00:00:38.594 --> 00:00:40.293
Clerk: For here or to go?

12
00:00:40.294 --> 00:00:43.774
Hana: For

13
00:00:43.775 --> 00:00:46.975
here. Clerk: That’ll be $4.25,

14
00:00:46.976 --> 00:00:48.587
please. Hana: Here you

15
00:00:48.588 --> 00:00:50.287
are. Clerk: A five dollar

16
00:00:50.288 --> 00:00:56.041
bill. That’s 75 cents change. Thank you.

17
00:00:56.042 --> 00:01:00.218
Hana: Umm . . . Can I have more ketchup?

18
00:01:00.219 --> 00:01:01.574
Clerk: Here you are.

19
00:01:01.575 --> 00:01:04.818
Hana: And where can I get a straw?

20
00:01:04.819 --> 00:01:10.642
Clerk: The straws are on the counter to your

21
00:01:10.643 --> 00:01:13.320
left. Hana: Oh, I see them. Thank

22
00:01:13.321 --> 00:01:14.977
you. Clerk: You are very

23
00:01:14.978 --> 00:01:18.521
